{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc 'cat round46ab-brief.md; cat render-r1.txt; ls gate-run24*; tail -15 mutants.log'","aggregated_output":"# Council round 46ab: after 46aa (read-only, same thread)\n\n46aa answered: changed() compares the same recomputed outcome that publication uses. CH5: declared $52.75B, recomputed and published $53.00B, against a previous published $52.70B: changed, with the outcome moving 52.7 to 53.0.\n\nGate run 24: 84 of 84, identical under PYTHONHASHSEED 1 to 3. Mutants: 44 of 44 caught. render-r1 clean.\n\nAnswer GATE PASS STANDS or GATE FAIL, sorting any finding as (A) blocking or (B) a relabelling for the blind readers. Only (A) blocks. If no (A) remains, say GATE PASS STANDS.\nsystem 4373 characters; user 121246 characters; schema 9626 characters\nevidence items 237; themes 9\nsource passages the answer cites that the rendered request does not show: none\nschema errors: none\ncalc_check errors: none\nrecorded: [{\"type\": \"bridge\", \"figure\": \"q4f\", \"bridge\": \"carry\", \"alternate\": \"undetermined\"}]\nsame-base family (calls 8729, 8732): Relations: v35 rests on v14's base.\ngate-run24.fixtures.json\ngate-run24.txt\nchanged reads the declared outcome | CH5 | CAUGHT (['CH5'])\nC3 off | R1a | CAUGHT (['R1a', 'R1qb', 'R1canon'])\ncrossings ignore open ends | R4b3 | CAUGHT (['R4b3', 'R4one'])\nC3 bounds use paired ends | R1qc | CAUGHT (['R1qc'])\nC3 impossibility ignores open ends | R1qb | CAUGHT (['R1qb'])\nbounds dropped in recomputation | R4one | CAUGHT (['R4one'])\nC1 accepts any substring (alone) | T9 | CAUGHT (['T9'])\nC5 allows estimates | P3b | CAUGHT (['P3b'])\nper-unit identity ignores scope | P4 | CAUGHT (['P4'])\nper-unit inverse loses its scale | G3inv | CAUGHT (['G3inv'])\nC2 tolerance 50% | P2 | CAUGHT (['P2', 'U2'])\nbound direction ignored | R4m | CAUGHT (['R2b2b', 'R4m'])\nC9 same base off (both clauses) | G4m | CAUGHT (['G24m', 'G24d', 'G24c', 'G24x', 'G4x', 'G4x2', 'G4b2', 'G4c', 'G4m'])\nC10 prior not authenticated | P3c | CAUGHT (['P3c'])\nAll rules have a mutant; none is left unexercised.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
